+    /**
+     * What this client can do beyond upstream's, which a mesh node is told on each join (`mesh_caps`, 1.0.2, as
+     * rtc-client 1.0.7 and 1.0.8): it stops sending an audio track nobody hears when its node says so
+     * (`LocalAudioTrack.setMeshHeard`), its room hands the node's codec policy to the product
+     * ([Room.meshCodecPolicy]), since 1.0.9 it reads its settings ([Room.meshSettings], fields 1002 and 102), and since
