+     * WordPlus Mesh (1.0.9): holds this camera's senders to the live caps ([io.livekit.android.room.MeshCaps]): each
+     * sender's encodings computed again by [encodingsFor] (null: the main sender's, else a backup codec's) under the
+     * caps, then dynacast's last word on top, so a layer nobody watches stays paused and one the caps turned off stays
+     * off. Caps lifted, the senders go back to what their options compute.
